markdown <<MARKDOWN
<h1>Reading an Event Handler in Code</h1>

You now know the three jobs: interact, listen, respond. Here's what that looks like as actual JavaScript. 

You don't need to memorize this syntax, you need to recognize *which lines are doing which job*, the same way you learned to read a CSS rule earlier in this unit.

